{"id":"ce790f46cab0681e","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition.md","title":"Extended Transition of an Epsilon-NFA","display":"df-epsilon-nfa-run — Extended Transition of an Epsilon-NFA","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition","aliases":["73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition","73-df-epsilon-nfa-run"],"display":"df-epsilon-nfa-run — Extended Transition of an Epsilon-NFA","depends_on":["[[73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure]]","[[73-df-epsilon-reachability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-epsilon-nfa-extended-transition</span><span>73-df-epsilon-nfa-run</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-epsilon-nfa-run — Extended Transition of an Epsilon-NFA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"554f551d165cef7f\" href=\"?note=554f551d165cef7f\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f4625243fc1dd8f0\" href=\"?note=f4625243fc1dd8f0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-reachability\">73-df-epsilon-reachability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{ENFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (epsilon-NFA, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"554f551d165cef7f\" href=\"?note=554f551d165cef7f\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure\">73-df-epsilon-nfa-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{EClos}_M:\\mathcal P(Q)\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\\)</span> (epsilon closure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f4625243fc1dd8f0\" href=\"?note=f4625243fc1dd8f0\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-reachability\">73-df-epsilon-reachability</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in Q\">\\(q\\in Q\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>；空词子句与后继子句共享这组参数类型。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_M(\\{q\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{EClos}_M(\\{q\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}epsilon\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}run}\\vdash\n\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,wa)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{EClos}_M\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{p\\in\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q,w)}\\delta(p,a)\n\\right)\n\\quad(q\\in Q,\\;w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\;a\\in\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" 